    "description": "The S3 controlled fault began 16.284-26.429 seconds after preparation rather than after the planned 30 seconds. All three stabilization windows completed with 100 percent ACK before every fault.",
    "analysis_scope": "Fallback and post-fault recovery timing remain comparable under identical state-machine settings; baseline exposure duration must not be compared as if it were identical."
