  "conclusion": "Both pairs completed fallback and recovery in all five cycles. With identical settings and Wi-Fi power saving disabled, average recovery differed by only 15 ms: 15.214 s for ESP32 and 15.229 s for ESP32-S3. The earlier long S3 recovery tail was therefore not reproduced under the standardized algorithm configuration.",
